\name{powermean-package}
\alias{powermean-package}
\alias{powermean}
\docType{package}
\title{Powermean for R}
\description{
Development version of the native R port of Powermean 0.1.1.
Estimate conditional power means with or without absorbed fixed effects
and inspect robust, clustered or heteroskedasticity-consistent inference
for the admitted models. Jochmans GMM1 and GMM2 estimate slopes using
complete rectangular or directed two-way observations.
}
